---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Now — Chris Thomas" description="What Chris is up to right now.">
  <main class="now-page">
    <header class="now-header">
      <h1>now</h1>
      <p class="mono updated">updated april 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; kanjirappally, kerala</p>
    </header>

    <section class="now-section">
      <h2 class="mono section-label">Work</h2>
      <p>senior PM at <strong>avaana</strong>, an australian healthtech startup. currently building their credits engine — a double-entry ledger system underneath their corporate wellbeing platform. distributed team, fully remote.</p>
      <p>relocating to bangalore in roughly two months. most of my professional life is already there anyway.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="now-section">
      <h2 class="mono section-label">Reading / Thinking</h2>
      <p>deep in <strong>vedic astrology</strong> and how it maps onto western esoteric systems — hermeticism, jungian shadow work, the broader question of whether consciousness is fundamental or emergent.</p>
      <p>also sitting with the overlap between magick as a practice and systems thinking as a discipline. more on this in writing soon.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="now-section">
      <h2 class="mono section-label">Everything else</h2>
      <p>rebuilding my gym routine after a month off — machine-based push/pull/legs. goa trip coming up mid-april.</p>
      <p>ride a <strong>gixxer SF 155</strong>. did a solo bangalore–trichy–kerala run last month. watching the used ninja 650 market with probably too much attention.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .now-page {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem 6rem;
  }

  .now-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .now-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .now-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .now-section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .now-section p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.75em;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .now-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .now-section strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
